# Plan: plans/20260611_qe-baseline-freeze-and-candidate-lock_plan.md
# Each non-comment row locks one generated/hand-maintained result file to a
# SHA-256 hash. The pre-commit hook (.githooks/pre-commit) rejects any commit
# that changes a listed file unless HAFISCAL_UNLOCK=1 is set AND this manifest
# is updated in the same commit. Code/HA-Models/test_locked_tables.py asserts
# working-tree integrity. The deliberate path to change a frozen file is
# reproduce/promote_candidates.py (`make promote-tables`).
#
# The hashes double as a durable record of the QE-published values: the
# HAFiscal-QE repo is ephemeral, so qe-source-rev pins provenance here.
#
